<section class="apex-cycle">
  <h2 class="apex-h2"><span class="apex-h2__slash mono">//</span>The architecture</h2>
  <p class="apex-dek apex-dek--dark">AION organizes accountability around stakeholder outcomes. Structure grows horizontally through explicit operations and workflows before it grows vertically through management layers.</p>
  <div class="apex-cycle__grid">
    <div class="apex-phase">
      <div class="apex-phase__top"><span class="mono apex-phase__idx">01</span><span class="mono apex-phase__tag apex-phase__tag--green">CONTEXT</span></div>
      <h3 class="apex-phase__name">Domain</h3>
      <div class="mono apex-phase__vel">related stakeholder outputs</div>
      <p class="apex-phase__body">Groups related outcomes under a named human Domain Owner. A human, agent, or hybrid supervisor maintains the governed system view.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="apex-arrow mono">→</div>
    <div class="apex-phase apex-phase--glow">
      <div class="apex-phase__top"><span class="mono apex-phase__idx">02</span><span class="mono apex-phase__tag apex-phase__tag--green">ACCOUNTABILITY</span></div>
      <h3 class="apex-phase__name">Operation</h3>
      <div class="mono apex-phase__vel">persistent outcome ownership</div>
      <p class="apex-phase__body">The durable unit of accountability. Orchestrators coordinate persistent Operators and temporary, task-scoped Workers within explicit authority.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="apex-arrow mono">→</div>
    <div class="apex-phase">
      <div class="apex-phase__top"><span class="mono apex-phase__idx">03</span><span class="mono apex-phase__tag apex-phase__tag--white">EXECUTION</span></div>
      <h3 class="apex-phase__name">Workflow</h3>
      <div class="mono apex-phase__vel">repeatable coordination</div>
      <p class="apex-phase__body">A deliberately designed path from a qualifying trigger to a stakeholder outcome or terminal disposition, with evidence at every boundary.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="apex-feedback mono"><span class="apex-feedback__rule"></span><span>domain → operation → workflow · outcome accountability remains explicit end to end</span><span class="apex-feedback__rule"></span></div>
</section>

<section id="principles" class="apex-principles">
  <h2 class="apex-h2 apex-h2--light apex-principles__h2"><span class="apex-h2__slash apex-h2__slash--light mono">//</span>The seven principles</h2>
  <div class="apex-principles__grid">
    <div class="apex-principle"><span class="mono apex-principle__num">01</span><div><span class="apex-principle__lead">Agents are first-class organizational citizens.</span> <span class="apex-principle__body">Give real roles the context, memory, skills, tools, evidence, and permissions they require.</span></div></div>
    <div class="apex-principle"><span class="mono apex-principle__num">02</span><div><span class="apex-principle__lead">Maximum useful explicitness.</span> <span class="apex-principle__body">What is overhead for humans can become leverage for agents.</span></div></div>
    <div class="apex-principle"><span class="mono apex-principle__num">03</span><div><span class="apex-principle__lead">Minimum necessary hierarchy.</span> <span class="apex-principle__body">Add operations, workflows, and interfaces before management depth.</span></div></div>
    <div class="apex-principle"><span class="mono apex-principle__num">04</span><div><span class="apex-principle__lead">Engineering-grade operations.</span> <span class="apex-principle__body">Apply versioning, testing, observability, rollback, and auditability to the organization itself.</span></div></div>
    <div class="apex-principle"><span class="mono apex-principle__num">05</span><div><span class="apex-principle__lead">Maximum relevant context. Minimum necessary authority.</span> <span class="apex-principle__body">Information required for sound judgment never implies permission to act.</span></div></div>
    <div class="apex-principle"><span class="mono apex-principle__num">06</span><div><span class="apex-principle__lead">If humans repeat, specify. If agents guess, escalate.</span> <span class="apex-principle__body">Encode repeatable knowledge and reserve genuine judgment for humans.</span></div></div>
    <div class="apex-principle"><span class="mono apex-principle__num">07</span><div><span class="apex-principle__lead">Optimize the constraint, not the node.</span> <span class="apex-principle__body">Improve what currently limits the stakeholder outcome before optimizing anything else.</span></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="apex-metrics">
  <h2 class="apex-h2 apex-h2--onGreen"><span class="apex-h2__slash apex-h2__slash--onGreen mono">//</span>The operating logic</h2>
  <p class="apex-dek apex-dek--onGreen">The target is reliable stakeholder value within explicit risk and authority boundaries — not maximum automation, minimum headcount, or full utilization.</p>
  <div class="apex-metrics__grid">
    <div class="apex-metric"><div class="mono apex-metric__id">01</div><div class="apex-metric__name">Explicit contracts</div><div class="apex-metric__body">Roles, interfaces, outcomes, and terminal states are versioned and inspectable.</div></div>
    <div class="apex-metric"><div class="mono apex-metric__id">02</div><div class="apex-metric__name">Bounded authority</div><div class="apex-metric__body">Authority is explicit, observable, revocable, and no broader than the contract requires.</div></div>
    <div class="apex-metric"><div class="mono apex-metric__id">03</div><div class="apex-metric__name">Evidence-based autonomy</div><div class="apex-metric__body">Autonomy expands only when observed performance supports it.</div></div>
    <div class="apex-metric"><div class="mono apex-metric__id">04</div><div class="apex-metric__name">Reserved judgment</div><div class="apex-metric__body">Human capacity is protected for consequence, uncertainty, relationships, and correction.</div></div>
    <div class="apex-metric"><div class="mono apex-metric__id">05</div><div class="apex-metric__name">Validated learning</div><div class="apex-metric__body">The durable advantage is the rate at which the organization observes and safely improves.</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

